+<!-- Desktop Portable module integration notes
+
+Goal:
+  Expose the Windows portable download inside SMTinel instead of sending users to
+  a separate portable.html landing page.
+
+Module file:
+  modules/desktop-portable.html
+
+Download target:
+  https://github.com/carmacorte/SMTinel/releases/latest/download/SMTinel-Windows-Portable.zip
+
+Recommended render function:
+
+  function renderDesktopPortableSection() {
+    return `
+      <section class="smtinel-module smtinel-desktop-portable-module">
+        <iframe
+          title="SMTinel Desktop Portable"
+          src="modules/desktop-portable.html"
+          style="width:100%;min-height:860px;border:0;border-radius:28px;background:transparent;"
+          loading="lazy"
+        ></iframe>
+      </section>
+    `;
+  }
+
+Recommended route id:
+  desktop-portable
+
+Recommended menu placement:
+  More -> Desktop Portable
+
+Recommended top quick action:
+  Download Desktop / Desktop Portable
+
+Important behavior:
+  - Do not route users to portable.html as the primary flow.
+  - Keep portable.html only as a fallback landing page.
+  - Do not store SMTinel-Windows-Portable.zip inside docs/ or the repository.
+  - Keep the ZIP in GitHub Releases and download it from the stable release URL.
+
+Validation:
+  1. Open SMTinel.
+  2. More -> Desktop Portable.
+  3. Confirm the module loads in-place.
+  4. Click Download Windows Portable.
+  5. Confirm the browser starts downloading the ZIP without opening GitHub.
